#: ../../../../../../docs/tutorials/index.md:8
msgid "从第一个应用开始"
msgstr "Start with the first application"

#: ../../../../../../docs/tutorials/index.md:10
msgid "没有硬件时先运行 Native 应用；需要 MCU 镜像时选择精确 F407 模板。 每条教程给出完整输入、命令和可观察的成功出口。"
msgstr ""
"Without hardware, run a Native application first. For an MCU image, select "
"the exact F407 template. Each tutorial provides complete inputs, commands "
"and observable success criteria."

#: ../../../../../../docs/tutorials/index.md:21
msgid ""
"已有工程可直接进入[任务指南](../guides/index.md)。SDK 制作与完整平台验收属于 "
"[维护流程](../development/index.md)。"
msgstr ""
"For an existing project, go directly to the [task "
"guides](../guides/index.md). SDK creation and complete platform acceptance "
"belong to the [maintenance workflows](../development/index.md)."
